[ Laughter ]
And then --

00:07:22.141 --> 00:07:23.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Of course.
-And then I had

00:07:23.342 --> 00:07:25.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
a hyperbaric chamber.

00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:28.047
And so I had a lot of just tim
where I wasn't doing anything,

00:07:28.047 --> 00:07:31.484
so I could just read and I would
just crush books in the sauna,

00:07:31.484 --> 00:07:35.121 align:start size:94% position:6%
outside in the cold tub,
and the hyperbaric.

00:07:35.121 --> 00:07:37.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
So that was one thing.
I had a lot of time on my hand

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:38.591 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and I just --

00:07:38.591 --> 00:07:40.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
That happened
for about nine months,

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:44.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
where I just was reading
and me and my two best friends

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:47.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
decided we wanted to start
like our own book club.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was probably
in November, December.

00:07:49.602 --> 00:07:51.270 line:92%
And then I approached my agenc

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:52.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they thought
it was a great idea,

00:07:52.805 --> 00:07:54.674 line:92%
a great way to promote literac

00:07:54.674 --> 00:07:59.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
and to engage with my fans
and just kind of show

00:07:59.111 --> 00:08:03.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I'm not just a one-side
baseball player kind of,

00:08:03.683 --> 00:08:04.350 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
you know.

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:05.151 line:92%
And one thing I've learned

00:08:05.151 --> 00:08:07.954 size:84% position:42%
and it really hit home,
in my most recent book,

00:08:07.954 --> 00:08:10.857 align:start size:94% position:6%
Kate Fagan's "All the Colors
came out is like

00:08:10.857 --> 00:08:14.527
you take everything that's
materialistic away from us

00:08:14.527 --> 00:08:17.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, at the end of the day
all we have is love and wisdom

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:19.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I think that's something
that you can really get

00:08:19.866 --> 00:08:20.900 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
from reading books.

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:23.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I agree with you 100%.
And it's so true,

00:08:23.302 --> 00:08:24.270 size:78% position:39% line:92%
what you say about --

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:26.072 line:92%
I always, when people ask me

00:08:26.072 --> 00:08:27.206 line:92%
any advice I have for them

00:08:27.206 --> 00:08:28.841 align:start size:94% position:6%
before they go into school
I'm always like,

00:08:28.841 --> 00:08:31.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You can't believe how littl
time you have to read,

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:33.145 size:88% position:44%
once you finish school."
Like it's the only time

00:08:33.145 --> 00:08:34.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
in your life where someone
says like,

00:08:34.514 --> 00:08:36.782 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Go back to your room,
read this book,

00:08:36.782 --> 00:08:39.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that's what we want yo
to do with your time."

00:08:39.185 --> 00:08:41.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so it's really nice,
I think, as an adult,

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
when you can find time
to do that.

00:08:42.555 --> 00:08:44.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Amen.
-I want to ask.

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.125 line:92%
You mentioned the ice bath

00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:50.229
When you go into an ice bath
how long do you go into it

00:08:50.229 --> 00:08:51.564 line:92%
-Between three and five minutes.

00:08:51.564 --> 00:08:52.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-It's pretty bad.

00:08:52.999 --> 00:08:55.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So you have to have
a really short book for that

00:08:55.668 --> 00:08:57.136 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:57.136 --> 00:08:59.705
-Yeah.
-So you go in, but can you read?

00:08:59.705 --> 00:09:00.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I can't read and do
the cold tub.

00:09:00.806 --> 00:09:02.708 size:81% position:41%
That's a bit too much.
-How miserable is it?

00:09:02.708 --> 00:09:03.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
Have you gotten better
at the cold tub?

00:09:03.809 --> 00:09:05.912 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well it's miserable,
but the point is

00:09:05.912 --> 00:09:08.281 line:92%
to find comfort in that misery

00:09:08.281 --> 00:09:11.450 size:78% position:39%
So like you're doing
other things, like --

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:12.818 size:88% position:44%
I don't know. It's hard
to explain, necessarily,

00:09:12.818 --> 00:09:15.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
but like, say, for example
like, you know, like the sayin

00:09:15.755 --> 00:09:17.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
"What doesn't kill us
can only make us stronger,

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:20.593 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's kind of like you
stress yourself a little bit

00:09:20.593 --> 00:09:23.462 align:start size:94% position:6%
so you can gain this
massive amount of strength

00:09:23.462 --> 00:09:25.998 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Gotcha.
-So, when I'm in there,
yeah, it sucks.

00:09:25.998 --> 00:09:28.267 size:84% position:42%
I try to find my breath
and try to find comfort

00:09:28.267 --> 00:09:30.403 align:start size:94% position:6%
within like the first
30 seconds.

00:09:30.403 --> 00:09:32.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I try to like --
I don't want to say

00:09:32.939 --> 00:09:34.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
like be happy,
but just try to relax in there

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:38.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
as much as I can and it just
gets easier over time.

00:09:38.477 --> 00:09:41.247 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I've always wondered
exactly how long people --

00:09:41.247 --> 00:09:42.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because even
just watching someone,

00:09:42.415 --> 00:09:44.016 line:92%
I feel my teeth chattering, so

00:09:44.016 --> 00:09:46.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, three to five minutes
is like

00:09:46.652 --> 00:09:48.254 line:92%
what I would I would say to do

00:09:48.254 --> 00:09:51.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like the worst part is
the 30 seconds when you get in

00:09:51.724 --> 00:09:54.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the 45 minutes
when you get out

00:09:54.327 --> 00:09:56.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
to warm yourself back up.

00:09:56.762 --> 00:09:58.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
Luckily, I just jump
in the sauna or whatever.

00:09:58.464 --> 00:10:00.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got a hot tub.
-Yeah, you got a good setup.

00:10:00.666 --> 00:10:03.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
One thing, you know, I wan
to apologize for the fact that

00:10:03.336 --> 00:10:06.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
shows like mine oftentimes use
the Mets as a punch line,

00:10:06.105 --> 00:10:07.840 align:start size:94% position:6%
but one of the things
that's really nice right now

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:09.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
is you guys are
a first-place team

00:10:09.275 --> 00:10:10.743 line:92%
going into the All-Star break.

00:10:10.743 --> 00:10:11.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
It would be very nice,
obviously,

00:10:11.844 --> 00:10:14.814
and I think we're all optimistic
that you can be a part

00:10:14.814 --> 00:10:17.416 size:88% position:44%
of what will, hopefully,
be a second-half push.

00:10:17.416 --> 00:10:19.485 size:81% position:41%
But I do want to close
with one last thing.

00:10:19.485 --> 00:10:23.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have a writer on this sho
who is a huge Mets fan

00:10:23.022 --> 00:10:24.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we were mentioning
you going to be here today

00:10:24.924 --> 00:10:27.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he said,
"I've met him twice,

00:10:27.426 --> 00:10:29.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
once at the airport
and once at --"

00:10:29.528 --> 00:10:32.698 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, that guy.
What is it, Stalker Sal?

00:10:32.698 --> 00:10:33.733 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:10:33.733 --> 00:10:35.001 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, that guy?

00:10:35.001 --> 00:10:36.002 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-So you remember him?

00:10:36.002 --> 00:10:36.969 line:92%
-Yeah. How could I forget?

00:10:36.969 --> 00:10:38.904 line:92%
Delta Terminal at LaGuardia.

00:10:38.904 --> 00:10:40.006 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:10:40.006 --> 00:10:41.974
-We were worried because,
when he told us the story,

00:10:41.974 --> 00:10:43.509 size:75% position:38%
he said like, "Yeah,
it was really cool

00:10:43.509 --> 00:10:45.578 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he was really excited
to meet me,"

00:10:45.578 --> 00:10:46.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we were like,
"I got to be honest, Sal.

00:10:46.779 --> 00:10:49.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like you might've bee
the creep in the story."

00:10:49.682 --> 00:10:51.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I couldn't get
away from the guy.

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:53.452 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:10:53.452 --> 00:10:55.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, so,
we're sorry about that.

00:10:55.554 --> 00:10:56.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you, though,
for being here

00:10:56.722 --> 00:10:58.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
and best of luck,
both with the rehabilitation

00:10:58.924 --> 00:11:00.926
and, hopefully, seeing you i
the second half of the season.

00:11:00.926 --> 00:11:02.995
-Thank you for having me.
-That's Noah Syndergaard.

00:11:02.995 --> 00:11:04.196 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't miss
the MLB All-Star Game,

00:11:04.196 --> 00:11:08.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
which airs this Tuesday nigh
at 8:00 pm on Fox.

